867
00:45:23,470 --> 00:45:24,870
We don't want to stumble on this later.

868
00:45:25,590 --> 00:45:26,630
Ah, it's so annoying.

869
00:45:26,850 --> 00:45:28,350
Piss off, stupid box.

870
00:45:32,560 --> 00:45:33,300
Push it in here.

871
00:45:39,600 --> 00:45:40,340
Okay, you know what?

872
00:45:41,300 --> 00:45:43,780
Uh, I kind of want to run back and turn off the generator.

873
00:45:44,300 --> 00:45:45,220
There's no light down here.

874
00:45:46,360 --> 00:45:46,720
Anyway.

875
00:45:48,740 --> 00:45:49,960
Yeah, I'm running back.

876
00:45:50,440 --> 00:45:51,200
I have a feeling.

877
00:45:54,020 --> 00:45:55,560
I don't see how we're gonna need it in here.

878
00:45:58,880 --> 00:46:00,100
Run back, run back, run back.

879
00:46:01,340 --> 00:46:02,900
I am preserving fuel, baby.

880
00:46:10,270 --> 00:46:10,770
Come on.

881
00:46:14,050 --> 00:46:14,410
Go.

882
00:46:18,770 --> 00:46:19,810
This is the smart play.

883
00:46:23,540 --> 00:46:24,260
Do I hear it?

884
00:46:27,570 --> 00:46:28,330
I think it's here.

885
00:46:29,050 --> 00:46:29,450
Somewhere.

886
00:46:30,950 --> 00:46:32,070
No, we're good, I think.

887
00:46:32,190 --> 00:46:32,310
Go.

888
00:46:41,170 --> 00:46:42,470
Turn that shit off.

889
00:46:43,430 --> 00:46:44,290
Okay, nice.

890
00:46:45,970 --> 00:46:46,690
Okay, good.

891
00:46:47,470 --> 00:46:47,990
Let's go.

892
00:46:53,160 --> 00:46:54,720
Maybe I'll bring a fresh one of these.

893
00:46:56,640 --> 00:46:58,140
I don't know what I'm gonna find down there.

894
00:46:58,880 --> 00:46:59,700
Okay, so, save.

895
00:47:00,920 --> 00:47:01,320
Go.

896
00:47:09,070 --> 00:47:10,390
Where's that light coming from?

897
00:47:11,670 --> 00:47:12,950
I thought the power was out.

898
00:47:25,690 --> 00:47:26,130
Okay.

899
00:47:28,910 --> 00:47:30,110
So far, so good.

900
00:47:31,370 --> 00:47:34,290
Don't tell me the water is back up again now, or some bullshit like that.

901
00:47:34,710 --> 00:47:35,870
Because that would make no sense.

902
00:47:38,330 --> 00:47:39,710
Okay, looks like the water's gone.

903
00:47:50,130 --> 00:47:51,790
Surprised there's no fuel just sitting here.

904
00:47:56,380 --> 00:47:57,440
Oh, thought that was fuel.

905
00:48:00,220 --> 00:48:02,080
See, it's just as dark here now as it was before.

906
00:48:12,920 --> 00:48:13,560
Oh, boy.

907
00:48:13,940 --> 00:48:14,720
Oh, boy.

908
00:48:16,240 --> 00:48:17,080
Wait, where's my light?

909
00:48:17,840 --> 00:48:18,580
Okay, there it is.

910
00:48:19,240 --> 00:48:19,560
Motherfucker!

911
00:48:24,800 --> 00:48:25,740
Okay, wait, wait, wait, wait.

912
00:48:25,980 --> 00:48:26,340
Let me see.

913
00:48:26,440 --> 00:48:28,540
It's gotta be a map of this place.

914
00:48:30,140 --> 00:48:31,140
It's just gotta be.

915
00:48:35,500 --> 00:48:37,260
So where did I come from just now?

916
00:48:40,940 --> 00:48:41,960
Did I come from here?

917
00:48:44,920 --> 00:48:46,780
There's a way right, and a way left.

918
00:48:50,970 --> 00:48:52,170
It turns right here.

919
00:48:54,110 --> 00:48:56,710
Yeah, I think I came from here just now, so I go here.

920
00:48:56,810 --> 00:48:58,170
We're gonna come to a big open area.

921
00:48:59,410 --> 00:49:00,670
Shaped like the pillbox.

922
00:49:01,490 --> 00:49:02,510
We turn right.

923
00:49:02,510 --> 00:49:04,810
It's a one-way trip.

924
00:49:06,350 --> 00:49:08,510
There's an open area over here.

925
00:49:10,350 --> 00:49:10,950
Okay.

926
00:49:14,760 --> 00:49:15,780
Oh, God, what's happening?

927
00:49:15,900 --> 00:49:16,060
Okay.

928
00:49:18,820 --> 00:49:19,760
There's a light.

929
00:49:24,040 --> 00:49:25,120
Oh, it's a lantern.

930
00:49:27,800 --> 00:49:28,560
Oh, look!

931
00:49:28,960 --> 00:49:30,620
A Roman column or pillar.

932
00:49:30,920 --> 00:49:32,300
Seems to be of Doric variety.

933
00:49:32,640 --> 00:49:36,100
Not to be confused with the Ionic or Corinthian, of course.

934
00:49:39,300 --> 00:49:40,440
Oh, my God!

935
00:49:41,040 --> 00:49:41,520
Yes!

936
00:49:42,820 --> 00:49:43,740
Holy shit!

937
00:49:44,080 --> 00:49:44,840
No way!

938
00:49:49,670 --> 00:49:51,250
The man is shooting open a door.

939
00:49:55,130 --> 00:49:55,610
Okay.

940
00:49:58,550 --> 00:50:00,530
Also, we never read the thing we found down here.

941
00:50:01,450 --> 00:50:02,350
Gathering of the willing.

942
00:50:03,630 --> 00:50:05,030
28th of May, 1916.

943
00:50:05,890 --> 00:50:12,090
After what happened with Neuer, after how Reynard and Fournier treated him and LaRue, there's only one way forward for us.

944
00:50:12,610 --> 00:50:14,050
I've gathered men I can trust.

945
00:50:14,310 --> 00:50:15,730
Propose to them what we will do.

946
00:50:16,130 --> 00:50:17,970
To a man, all of them were willing.

947
00:50:18,330 --> 00:50:19,550
It was such a relief.

948
00:50:20,530 --> 00:50:22,110
T seemed eager to go.

949
00:50:22,330 --> 00:50:23,210
The poor man.

950
00:50:23,370 --> 00:50:26,430
I hear him at night, muttering in rhymes, trying to comfort himself.

951
00:50:26,810 --> 00:50:30,350
For his sake, for all our sakes, this nightmare must stop.

952
00:50:31,230 --> 00:50:33,030
Late now, on the 14th of June.

953
00:50:33,470 --> 00:50:34,870
The nightmares have stopped.

954
00:50:35,070 --> 00:50:36,770
We no longer hear those sounds.

955
00:50:36,770 --> 00:50:39,550
But now I am plagued by worse nightmares.

956
00:50:40,090 --> 00:50:42,350
My fellow saboteurs were all caught.

957
00:50:43,230 --> 00:50:45,370
Delpy and Reynard torture them even now.

958
00:50:45,710 --> 00:50:47,570
And yet none of them have turned me in.

959
00:50:47,830 --> 00:50:49,710
I alone have escaped punishment.

960
00:50:49,710 --> 00:50:54,350
The honor among these men, my brothers, I'm not worthy of it.

961
00:50:54,550 --> 00:50:55,470
It haunts me.

962
00:50:55,890 --> 00:50:57,010
The guilt of it.

963
00:50:57,350 --> 00:50:59,250
I know they will be court-martialed.

964
00:50:59,530 --> 00:51:00,930
Maybe even put to death.

965
00:51:01,210 --> 00:51:02,290
And here I am.

966
00:51:02,930 --> 00:51:03,870
My consolation?

967
00:51:04,150 --> 00:51:05,630
The war will punish me.

968
00:51:05,970 --> 00:51:07,490
As it punishes us all.

969
00:51:07,910 --> 00:51:09,290
And I will remain vigilant.

970
00:51:09,630 --> 00:51:12,230
Lest whatever darkness lurks in those tunnels returns.

971
00:51:13,610 --> 00:51:14,170
Okay.

972
00:51:15,030 --> 00:51:16,430
Now what did we just find?

973
00:51:16,450 --> 00:51:17,310
This is gonna be a problem.

974
00:51:23,360 --> 00:51:25,480
Uh, what did we just find?

975
00:51:37,530 --> 00:51:38,950
Let's get the hell out of here.

976
00:51:39,230 --> 00:51:39,910
Unknown author?

977
00:51:40,070 --> 00:51:40,610
Keep the light on?

978
00:51:41,230 --> 00:51:41,910
Oh no.

979
00:51:42,210 --> 00:51:42,830
Not that one.

980
00:51:43,870 --> 00:51:44,310
Hmm.

981
00:51:48,740 --> 00:51:49,720
Not that one either.

982
00:51:50,780 --> 00:51:51,820
LaRue's report.

983
00:51:54,080 --> 00:51:54,720
Uh.

984
00:51:57,820 --> 00:51:58,820
Not this one.

985
00:51:58,900 --> 00:51:59,740
We read that one already.

986
00:52:00,300 --> 00:52:00,940
Stafford?

987
00:52:02,700 --> 00:52:04,160
Where's the pillbox key?

988
00:52:06,380 --> 00:52:07,020
No.

989
00:52:09,680 --> 00:52:10,580
Toussaint's madness?

990
00:52:12,780 --> 00:52:13,420
Hmm.

991
00:52:18,420 --> 00:52:19,180
Is this it?

992
00:52:19,500 --> 00:52:20,400
Have I read this?

993
00:52:26,380 --> 00:52:28,260
I mean, this guy is losing his mind.

994
00:52:40,490 --> 00:52:41,190
Dude.

995
00:52:42,370 --> 00:52:44,630
How will I ever find this?

996
00:52:48,900 --> 00:52:50,720
The officers have fled.

997
00:52:52,540 --> 00:52:54,380
I have the communications.

998
00:53:00,050 --> 00:53:01,550
Assumptions about motive?

999
00:53:06,300 --> 00:53:07,280
Shooting the beast.

1000
00:53:07,760 --> 00:53:08,380
No.

1001
00:53:09,360 --> 00:53:10,540
Oh man.

1002
00:53:16,760 --> 00:53:18,280
Not that one either.

1003
00:53:21,220 --> 00:53:23,580
I think it may have been, uh...

1004
00:53:24,040 --> 00:53:24,640
This one.

1005
00:53:26,800 --> 00:53:29,200
Yeah, I don't remember this, I don't think.

1006
00:53:30,480 --> 00:53:31,240
I don't know.

1007
00:53:32,800 --> 00:53:34,060
I don't know which one it is.

1008
00:53:34,520 --> 00:53:35,380
Here's what I'm gonna do.

1009
00:53:35,860 --> 00:53:37,960
It's been an hour, uh, almost anyway.

1010
00:53:38,020 --> 00:53:39,120
And we have a safe spot now.

1011
00:53:39,300 --> 00:53:40,120
I'm gonna take a break.

1012
00:53:40,120 --> 00:53:40,860
Look at the vaught.

1013
00:53:40,960 --> 00:53:41,520
Which one it is?

1014
00:53:41,800 --> 00:53:43,420
And in the next one, I'm gonna read that.

1015
00:53:43,480 --> 00:53:43,660
Okay?

1016
00:53:44,460 --> 00:53:44,820
Yeah.

1017
00:53:45,020 --> 00:53:45,900
That's how we're gonna do this.

1018
00:53:46,640 --> 00:53:47,620
Alright, I'll see you then.

1019
00:53:47,760 --> 00:53:48,000
Bye-bye.
